{"title": "Bounty Hunter", "pageid": 19547, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bounty_Hunter", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bounty_Hunter.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Bounty_Hunter.webp/300px-Bounty_Hunter.webp, /w/images/d/dc/Bounty_Hunter.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Bounty_Hunter.webp/300px-Bounty_Hunter.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Bounty_Hunter.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Bounty Hunter</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a> passive effect of <a href=\"/wiki/Favoured_Enemy\" title=\"Favoured Enemy\">Favoured Enemy</a>. Your mastery at hunting bounties shines through. You gain proficiency in Investigation and enemies have Disadvantage on their saving throw vs Ensnaring Strike.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Gain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Investigation\" title=\"Investigation\">Investigation</a>. Creatures you hit with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnaring Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Ensnaring_Strike_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnaring_Strike\" title=\"Ensnaring Strike\">Ensnaring Strike</a> (either ranged or melee) have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on their <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;p